AB  - The integration of generative AI into computational design has led to groundbreaking advancements in various fields, including architecture, engineering, and industrial design. However, leveraging the full potential of AI-driven design requires intuitive tools that combine the power of algorithmic scripting with the flexibility of machine learning. This paper introduces PM4GenAI, a scriptable parametric modeling interface designed to bridge this gap, enabling seamless interaction between parametric design workflows and generative AI algorithms. Built on the PM4VR platform, PM4GenAI empowers designers to leverage AI's generative capabilities while maintaining control over the design process through parametric modeling. We clarify the PM4GenAI's framework and demonstrate its potential to foster innovative design solutions through experiment results.
